{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05868","headline":"留别山中温古上人兄幷示舍弟缙 · 王维","name":"留别山中温古上人兄幷示舍弟缙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解薜登天朝，去师偶时哲。\n岂惟山中人，兼负松上月。\n宿昔同游止，致身云霞末。\n开轩临颍阳，卧视飞鸟没。\n好依盘石饭，屡对瀑泉渴。\n理齐小狎隐，道胜宁外物。\n舍弟官崇高，宗兄此削髪。\n荆扉但洒扫，乘闲当过歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}